    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88912" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσδι-ορθόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>correct, set right as well</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς μαθητάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
					<u>Vit.Pl.</u>
					p.6W.
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				2.87
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>pay up, make good in addition</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταγώγιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PEleph.</u>
					14.10
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				20.60
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				2693
			</span></i><i>e.</i><i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Mylasa</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>restore as well</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ προσδεόμενα ἐπισκευῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					90.34
				</span></i>
			 (Rosetta, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>).</div>
